er in information management services, and we are trusted by more than 240,000 customers in 61 countries, including approximately 95% of the Fortune 1000, to help unlock value and intelligence from their assets through services that transcend the physical and digital worlds. Our broad range of solutions address their information management, digital transformation, information security, data center and asset lifecycle management (\"ALM\") needs. Our longstanding commitment to safety, security, sustainability and innovation in support of our customers underpins everything we do. We currently serve customers across an array of market verticals — commercial, legal, financial, healthcare, technology, insuran","zh":"Iron Mountain Incorporated 是一家特拉華州公司（「IMI」），於 1951 年在紐約哈德遜附近的地下設施中成立，用於儲存業務記錄。如今，我們已成為資訊管理服務領域的全球領導者，受到 61 個國家/地區超過 240,000 名客戶（包括財富 1000 強企業中約 95% 的客戶）的信賴，透過超越實體和數位世界的服務幫助他們釋放資產的價值和智慧。我們廣泛的解決方案可滿足他們的資訊管理、數位轉型、資訊安全、資料中心和資產生命週期管理（「ALM」）需求。我們對安全、保障、永續發展和創新的長期承諾為客戶提供支持，這是我們所做一切的基礎。目前，我們為一系列市場垂直領域的客戶提供服務—商業、法律、金融、醫療保健、科技、保險"},{"en":"We are listed on the New York Stock Exchange (the \"NYSE\") and are a constituent of the Standard & Poor's 500 Index, the Morgan Stanley Capital International (\"MSCI\") REIT index and the FTSE EPRA Nareit Global Real Estate Index. As of December 31, 2025, we were number 567 on the Fortune 1000. We have been organized and have operated as a REIT beginning with our taxable year ended December 31, 2014.","zh":"我們在紐約證券交易所（「NYSE」）上市，是標準普爾 500 指數、摩根士丹利資本國際（「MSCI」）房地產投資信託指數和富時 EPRA Nareit 全球房地產指數的成分股。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們在財富 1000 強中排名第 567 位。從截至 2014 年 12 月 31 日的納稅年度開始，我們已作為房地產投資信託基金進行組織和營運。"},{"en":"Our strategy is to be the leading partner to our more than 240,000 customers by providing a broad range of end-to-end solutions leveraging our strong reputation for security and chain of custody, decades-long relationships built on trust, and global footprint and operational scale. With leadership positions in physical records management, digital solutions, data center, and asset lifecycle management, Iron Mountain serves as a key global partner for enterprises.","zh":"我們的策略是利用我們在安全和監管鏈方面的良好聲譽、建立在信任基礎上的長達數十年的關係以及全球足跡和營運規模，提供廣泛的端到端解決方案，成為超過 240,000 家客戶的領先合作夥伴。 Iron Mountain 在實體記錄管理、數位解決方案、資料中心和資產生命週期管理方面處於領先地位，是企業的重要全球合作夥伴。"}],"markets":[{"en":"The amount of revenues derived from our business segments and other relevant data, including financial information about geographic areas and product and service lines, for the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023, are set forth in Note 10 to Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements included in this Annual Report.","zh":"截至2025年12月31日、2024年及2023年12月31日止年度，來自我們業務部門的收入金額和其他相關數據，包括有關地理區域以及產品和服務線的財務資訊，載於本年報告中的合併財務報表附註的附註10。"},{"en":"Records Management, stores physical records and provides information services, vital records services, courier operations, and the collection, handling and disposal of sensitive documents (\"Records Management\") for customers in 61 countries around the globe.","zh":"記錄管理，儲存實體記錄，並為全球 61 個國家的客戶提供資訊服務、重要記錄服務、快遞業務以及敏感文件的收集、處理和處置（「記錄管理」）。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Iron Mountain Incorporated, a Delaware corporation (\"IMI\"), was founded in an underground facility near Hudson, New York in 1951 where it stored business records. Today, we are a global leader in information management services, and we are trusted by more than 240,000 customers in 61 countries, including approximately 95% of the Fortune 1000, to help unlock value and intelligence from their assets through services that transcend the physical and digital worlds. Our broad range of solutions address their information management, digital transformation, information security, data center and asset lifecycle management (\"ALM\") needs. Our longstanding commitment to safety, security, sustainability and innovation in support of our customers underpins everything we do. We currently serve customers across an array of market verticals — commercial, legal, financial, healthcare, technology, insuran","zh":"Iron Mountain Incorporated 是一家特拉華州公司（「IMI」），於 1951 年在紐約哈德遜附近的地下設施中成立，用於儲存業務記錄。如今，我們已成為資訊管理服務領域的全球領導者，受到 61 個國家/地區超過 240,000 名客戶（包括財富 1000 強企業中約 95% 的客戶）的信賴，透過超越實體和數位世界的服務幫助他們釋放資產的價值和智慧。我們廣泛的解決方案可滿足他們的資訊管理、數位轉型、資訊安全、資料中心和資產生命週期管理（「ALM」）需求。我們對安全、保障、永續發展和創新的長期承諾為客戶提供支持，這是我們所做一切的基礎。目前，我們為一系列市場垂直領域的客戶提供服務—商業、法律、金融、醫療保健、科技、保險"}],"competition":[{"en":"We face competition from numerous storage and information management services providers globally, as well as storage and information management services that are managed and operated internally by organizations. Competition for records and information customers is driven by factors such as pricing, reputation and reliability, the quality and security of storage solutions and the scope and scale of technology. While the majority of our competitors operate in only one market or region, we believe we provide a differentiated global offering that competes effectively in these areas.","zh":"我們面臨來自全球眾多儲存和資訊管理服務提供者以及由組織內部管理和營運的儲存和資訊管理服務的競爭。記錄和資訊客戶的競爭由定價、聲譽和可靠性、儲存解決方案的品質和安全性以及技術的範圍和規模等因素驅動。雖然我們的大多數競爭對手僅在一個市場或地區運營，但我們相信我們提供了一種差異化的全球產品，可以在這些領域進行有效競爭。"},{"en":"We also compete with numerous data center developers, owners and operators, many of whom own properties comparable to ours in several of the same metropolitan areas where our facilities are located. We believe that competition for data center customers is based on availability of power, security measures, location, connectivity and rental rates, and we are confident in our ability to compete effectively in each of these areas. Additionally, we believe our strong brand, global footprint and excellent commercial relationships empower us to compete successfully and provide significant cross-selling opportunities with our existing customer base.","zh":"我們也與眾多資料中心開發商、所有者和營運商競爭，其中許多人在我們的設施所在的幾個大都市區擁有與我們相當的房產。我們相信，資料中心客戶的競爭取決於電力的可用性、安全措施、位置、連接性和租金，並且我們對自己在這些領域中有效競爭的能力充滿信心。此外，我們相信我們強大的品牌、全球足跡和良好的商業關係使我們能夠成功競爭，並為現有客戶群提供重要的交叉銷售機會。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Reportable Segment Aggregation Before Other Operating","val":6094910000,"zh":"其他經營分部之前的可報告分部總結"},{"name":"Global Recordsand Information Management Business","val":5291481000,"zh":"全球記錄與資訊管理業務"},{"name":"Global Data Center Business","val":803429000,"zh":"全球資料中心業務"}],"total":6901737000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Records Management","val":4383195000,"zh":"記錄管理"},{"name":"Storage Rental","val":4052510000,"zh":"倉儲租賃"},{"name":"Service","val":2849227000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Information Destruction","val":1210451000,"zh":"資訊破壞"},{"name":"Data Center","val":803429000,"zh":"資料中心"},{"name":"Data Management","val":504662000,"zh":"資料管理"}],"total":6901737000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":4573462000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other International","val":1553243000,"zh":"其他國際"},{"name":"GB","val":472611000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"CA","val":302421000,"zh":"加拿大"}],"total":6901737000}},"peers":["DLR","WPC","CCI","VTR","OHI"]}}